      "side": 1,
      "message": "This check is here so that we only generate one XML-formatted symbol file per NDK library (rather than creating a copy for each stub that gets generated).\n\nThe symbol file (and corresponding XML) contains the list of common as well as architecture-specific APIs, so we\u0027ll still see the 32-bit APIs even if we only generate the XML when compiling the 64-bit variant.\n\nOf course, we\u0027ll actually need to run the tests on a 32-bit target to see whether these APIs are covered, but this CL is only concerned with tracking the set of APIs that a library exposes.",
